Following a <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/01/26/apple-announces-new-airtag/">new AirTag in January</a>, Apple is set to unveil its next new products of 2026 starting today. Apple CEO Tim Cook teased that the company will have a "<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/26/apple-teases-a-big-week-ahead/">big week ahead</a>," with announcements set to begin this Monday, March 2.<br/>
