Apple is reportedly planning a three-day stretch of product announcements from Monday, March 2 through Wednesday, March 4, with <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/22/five-new-apple-products-next-week/">at least five new products</a> expected to be unveiled, including <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/20/low-cost-macbook-latest-rumors/">a lower-cost MacBook</a>, an <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/08/iphone-17e-launch-imminent-with-four-features/">iPhone 17e</a>, and more.<br/>
<br/>
